{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And the youngest</b> — Two times in the Masorah: והצעיר כצעירתו (and the youngest as her youngest). והצעיר לגוי עצום (and the youngest to a mighty nation). Benjamin, who was the youngest, he made greater than all of them, as written: and the portion of Benjamin exceeded the portions of them all."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:19.828226045Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}